      "header": "Final cornerstone allocation (% of base offer)",
      "group": "cornerstone_final",
      "kind": "number",
      "unit": "decimal",
      "missing": "NaN",
      "hint": "最终基石股数 ÷ base offer（不含超额配售）。优先用公告基石表的 Total 行；若表内已给『假设超额配售权未行使』的百分比，可直接采用。**若公告与招股书均无基石投资者（无基石表、全文无 Cornerstone Investor），必须填 0 —— 这是「确定的零」，不得留 NaN。**"
    },
    {
      "key": "col_CM",
      "col": "CM",
      "header": "Subscription Ratio (times)",
      "group": "demand",
      "kind": "number",
      "unit": "times",
      "missing": "NaN",
      "hint": "香港公开发售认购倍数。公告常见表述：over-subscribed by N times / Subscription level N times。填倍数（如 2347.53）。"
    },
    {
      "key": "col_CN",
      "col": "CN",
      "header": "Public applicants",
      "group": "demand",
      "kind": "integer",
      "unit": "count",
      "missing": "NaN",
      "hint": "有效申请数目（valid applications）。填人的个数，不是股数。"
    },
    {
      "key": "col_CO",
      "col": "CO",
      "header": "Public valid applied shares",
      "group": "demand",
      "kind": "integer",
      "unit": "shares",
      "missing": "NaN",
      "hint": "有效申请所涉及的股数（total number of Offer Shares applied for）。**正文常不直接给总数**：请去 `BASIS OF ALLOCATION UNDER THE HONG KONG PUBLIC OFFERING` 表，把 Pool A 与 Pool B 各档的『NO. OF SHARES APPLIED FOR』逐档加总（表内『NO. OF VALID APPLICATIONS』列是人数，别加错），并可用『初始公开发售股数 × 认购倍数』做交叉验证。"
    },
    {
      "key": "col_CP",
      "col": "CP",
      "header": "Public subscription original wording",
      "group": "demand",
      "kind": "text",
      "unit": "text",
      "missing": "NA",
