      "group": "shareholding",
      "kind": "number",
      "unit": "decimal",
      "missing": "NaN",
      "hint": "上市时公众持股比例（小数）。"
    },
    {
      "key": "col_CZ",
      "col": "CZ",
      "header": "Share base used for both public shareholding ratios",
      "group": "shareholding",
      "kind": "integer",
      "unit": "shares",
      "missing": "NaN",
      "hint": "计算公众持股比例所用的分母股数。公告里通常写作 Number of issued Shares upon Listing (before exercise of the Over-allotment Option)；也可能需要从公众持股百分比反算。**不要因为公告用了市值口径就不填**——先找这一行的股数。"
    },
    {
      "key": "col_DA",
      "col": "DA",
      "header": "Unrestricted public shareholding at listing (%)",
      "group": "shareholding",
      "kind": "number",
      "unit": "decimal",
      "missing": "NaN",
      "hint": "不受禁售限制的公众持股比例（小数）。公告若直接给 free float 百分比就直接用；若只给自由流通股数，则 = 自由流通股数 ÷ col_CZ。**自由流通股数 = 本次全球发售股份(col_CS) − 基石获配股份(= col_CK × col_CS)**。**不要用 col_CY − col_CK**：那会漏掉其他受禁售的上市前股东（如 PRC 法律下 12 个月禁售的内资股）。"
    },
    {
      "key": "col_DB",
      "col": "DB",
      "header": "Free float denominator description",
      "group": "shareholding",
      "kind": "text",
      "unit": "text",
